{"id":"1aa90829d13d417c","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence.md","title":"HEO 的 PER 性与一阶外延性","display":"thm-heo-partial-equivalence — HEO 的 PER 性与一阶外延性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence","aliases":["72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence"],"display":"thm-heo-partial-equivalence — HEO 的 PER 性与一阶外延性","depends_on":["[[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §3.3(iii), print431/PDF443; local structural proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-heo-partial-equivalence — HEO 的 PER 性与一阶外延性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"caae2f23e6ca3d53\" href=\"?note=caae2f23e6ca3d53\" title=\"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations\">72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §3.3(iii), print431/PDF443; local structural proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"caae2f23e6ca3d53\" href=\"?note=caae2f23e6ca3d53\" title=\"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations\">72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations</a> 的关系、类型及部分函数编号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,d,c\\in\\omega\">\\(e,d,c\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\ \\forall e,d,c\\in\\omega\\quad\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\Rightarrow d\\sim_\\sigma e)\\land\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\land d\\sim_\\sigma c\\Rightarrow e\\sim_\\sigma c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\ \\forall e,d,c\\in\\omega\\quad\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\Rightarrow d\\sim_\\sigma e)\\land\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\land d\\sim_\\sigma c\\Rightarrow e\\sim_\\sigma c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e\\sim_{\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\mathbf n}d\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists b\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b\\land\\varphi_d(a)\\downarrow=b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e\\sim_{\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\mathbf n}d\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists b\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b\\land\\varphi_d(a)\\downarrow=b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>基型和积类型直接归纳。箭头的对称性同时交换两个相关输入及两个输出，使用子类型对称性。传递时对 a∼b，先用 e∼d 在 a,a 上得 e(a)∼d(a)，再用 d∼c 在 a,b 上得 d(a)∼c(b)，由计算单值性和输出 PER 传递性连接。空输入支撑时箭头关系为全关系，仍是 PER。一阶等价式由输入数类型的相等及输出数类型的相等直接展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations","status":"resolved","id":"caae2f23e6ca3d53","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations","status":"resolved","id":"caae2f23e6ca3d53","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] 的关系、类型及部分函数编号；$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}$，$e,d,c\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}","display":false},{"tex":"e,d,c\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\ \\forall e,d,c\\in\\omega\\quad\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\Rightarrow d\\sim_\\sigma e)\\land\n(e\\sim_\\sigma d\\land d\\sim_\\sigma c\\Rightarrow e\\sim_\\sigma c).","display":true},{"tex":"e\\sim_{\\mathbf n\\Rightarrow_r\\mathbf n}d\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ \\exists b\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=b\\land\\varphi_d(a)\\downarrow=b).","display":true}],"bytes":1751,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-531","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"}],"outgoing":["caae2f23e6ca3d53"]}